  "description": "Market Is COILING for its next move up...",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Saturday! Market, per usual, rattled investor mid-week… and then upwards towards the end of the week. Headlines keep shaking retail out of what would be great positions, thus I remain adamant: ignore the news! At least in regard to your portfolio. </p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-ranked-27-stocks-these-3-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">27 Stocks Ranks. 1 Came Out On Top.</a></h4><ul><li><p>This was one of the better lists of your favorite stocks. 13 tickers were marked as “buys.” These had strong developed trends, good fundamentals, high relative strength… and many had imminent bullish chart structures. </p></li></ul><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/xometry-breaks-51-and-im-buying-another?r=4z8lgl\">A Stock I Bought This Week</a></h4><ul><li><p>Our Midweek Movers series has produced winners averaging 25.9% this year, each. And so I decided to pick one up that just started its breakout. </p></li></ul><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-reviewed-every-stock-we-own-heres?r=4z8lgl\">Review of All Our Current Positions</a></h4><ul><li><p>The current status on each of my own positions. </p></li></ul><p>Nothing alarming or scary happened in the market… which is a great sign. It signals to me we are just consolidating (coiling) still for the next leg upwards. </p><p>As always, if you have questions, feel free to swing by the main chat during market hours. Make sure you take some time off this weekend, away from the charts, so you come in with a fresh mind on Monday. </p><p><strong>Please do like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post, to combat the AI slop. </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/many-stocks-in-buy-territory-now?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/many-stocks-in-buy-territory-now?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/many-stocks-in-buy-territory-now?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Timothy’s StockTok is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
